{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20249","headline":"吊卢殷 三 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"棘针风相号，破碎诸苦哀。\n苦哀不可闻，掩耳亦入来。\n哭弦多煎声，恨涕有余摧。\n噫贫气已焚，噫死心更灰。\n梦世浮闪闪，泪波深洄洄。\n薤歌一以去，蒿闭不复开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}